# ── Deliberately NOT ignored ───────────────────────────────────────
# src/backend/openapi/Api.json  — the API contract is committed on purpose;
#   the frontend client is generated from this file and CI fails on drift.
# src/frontend/src/lib/api/generated/  — generated but committed, so a type
#   error shows up at review time rather than at build time.

# Claude Code worktrees are checkouts of this repo, not content of it.
.claude/worktrees/
